# Transformed External References

This directory stores external design references that have been transformed to match the Thoven design system.

## File Format

Each transformed reference should be a markdown file with:

1. Original reference description or link
2. Transformation decisions made
3. Final Thoven implementation code

## Example Structure

```markdown
# [Reference Name] Transformation

## Original Reference
[Description, screenshot, or URL of the original design]

## Analysis
- Colors used: [list]
- Typography: [notes]
- Patterns: [notes]

## Transformation Mapping
| Original | Thoven Equivalent |
|----------|-------------------|
| [color] | amber-500 |
| [font] | font-sans |
| ... | ... |

## Thoven Implementation
[Final code using Thoven patterns]
```
